# a slow crawl (gas 80 ms in 800) towards the drop with the stick hard forward, then both brakes held
# from 4 s as the front wheel goes over the lip: a slow endo
stick l 0 -1
press cross 80
wait 720
press cross 80
wait 720
press cross 80
wait 720
press cross 80
wait 720
press cross 80
wait 720
down r2
down square
wait 8000
release
